{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233160","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1423316001:1":{"text":"あの、すみません……","source_cn":"您好，我想问一下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABF56530C116A8E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423316002:1":{"text":"あら、あんた！いつぞやの、おっちょこちょいの見習い司祭じゃないか！","source_cn":"哎，你是那个笨手笨脚的见习祭司！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8FD245C271D28A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423316003:1":{"text":"もう見習いじゃないわ。ちゃんと下級司祭になった……って、そもそも、もう司祭でもなんでもないか……","source_cn":"我现在已经不是见习祭司了，已经被升任为低阶祭司……哦不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x206A2343BACD4051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423316004:1":{"text":"あなたは……？","source_cn":"你是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C23D710CB57C5AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423316005:1":{"text":"忘れたのかい？あたしはナリンだよ。昔、王都でちょっとしたミスをして、司祭に引き渡されたとき、あんたに処罰の印を入れられたんだ。","source_cn":"你忘记了呀，我叫奈琳，当初在王城犯了点小错，被抓起来交...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB88524A85ED974BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t